""}, {"path": "/@TRPG_meiji/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8ae98ebe/uploads/origins/1ca3cb3e-f105-432a-84c0-10333f2219cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56af9fdd62830b422f81e663f9810f95", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8ae98ebe/uploads/origins/1ca3cb3e-f105-432a-84c0-10333f2219cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56af9fdd62830b422f81e663f9810f95, https://si.imgix.net/8ae98ebe/uploads/origins/1ca3cb3e-f105-432a-84c0-10333f2219cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d0bd4ec1bd40c32dcd94fababfb0b18 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8ae98ebe/uploads/origins/1ca3cb3e-f105-432a-84c0-10333f2219cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ae7c613779b3648228b522c5430a204 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します。\n\n煙ちゃんが沼ってる煙ちゃん宅といむさんという方（この方は鍵垢です）のうちよそを描いていただきたいです。\nCS等の画像はこちらになります。\n衣装等はこちらにそぐわなくて大丈夫です。多分好きに描いてもらった方が喜ぶかも。\n\n距離感は多分近い近いと思います。\n\nhttps://x.com/enhomolo/status/1509918252335796224?s=46&t=pd0YOxnB_tLueb9f1nIrPA\n\nhttps://x.com/tdr_mys/status/1539539086922645505?s=46&t=pd0YOxnB_tLueb9f1nIrPA\n\nhttps://x.com/tdr_mys/status/1509933940341157890?s=46&t=pd0YOxnB_tLueb9f1nIrPA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG_meiji/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/56ae4f4d/uploads/origins/bcf0ba02-64c5-4aa2-a9f1-99b839e359ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=744732cd0fb1aafa9ebb41cf8c11d093", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/56ae4f4d/uploads/origins/bcf0ba02-64c5-4aa2-a9f1-99b839e359ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=744732cd0fb1aafa9ebb41cf8c11d093, https://si.imgix.net/56ae4f4d/